  "description": "Ki-hyuk, a high school classmate, and Yoon-woo, who have been sexual partners for a long time. He feels extremely depressed about the ambiguous relationship between friends and less than lovers, and Ki-hyuk's attitude of only looking for himself when necessary. Meanwhile, in heaven, the angel 'Jun' is waiting for the day when he can't forget Yoon-woo, who had been kind to him, who was a puppy, even after he died. One day, when Yun-woo's fate written on the list changes to 'Train to Hell', Joon breaks the rules and descends into the human world to change his fate. And unlike Ki-hyuk, he begins to melt Yun-woo's frozen heart with a warm and friendly attack of affection...\n\n“Yoon-woo, I can wait. I will never leave.”  \n“With him… I can laugh.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/toHeaven), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561007957), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=210028), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000047210), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lost_ticket_to_heaven), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5954985)",
